    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`MultiModalStaticCache.set` evicts existing entries before discovering that a new embedding exceeds the entire byte budget. The new entry is rejected, but all previous cache hits are lost. This can happen with an oversized image/video request under `SGLANG_VLM_CACHE_SIZE_MB`.\n\n## Modifications\n\nReject an oversized entry before eviction. Keep the existing duplicate-key behavior and size calculation, so an admissible slice backed by a larger storage can still be cloned into the cache. Add byte-budget, LRU, duplicate-key, view, and zero-capacity regressions.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- Four CPU test methods pass; the original code fails four subcases covering retained entries/LRU and exact/zero-capacity caches.\n- Actual direct-encoder/cache source reproduction: requests for a small item, an oversized item, then the same small item invoke the encoder three times before and twice after, with identical outputs.\n- Local validation loads the unchanged source definitions while excluding GPU-facing package initializers; the model boundary returns real CPU tensors. No GPU/model inference run is claimed.\n- Touched-file pre-commit hooks pass, including CPU test registration.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nThe reproduction checks avoided encoder calls, not GPU throughput or latency.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Added registered CPU tests.\n- [x] Formatted and checked touched files with pre-commit.\n- [x] Preserved admission behavior for fitting entries and duplicate keys.\n\nAI assistance was used for implementation, regression tests, and review.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36867732009](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36867732009)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36867731734](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36867731734)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36867731943](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36867731943)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
